    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d762">

                <pb facs="0943" n="935" sameAs="frus:frus1941v04/pg935"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.9411/74: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-04-10T13:00:00+03:00">April 10, 1941—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 2:27 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>726. The Chinese Ambassador<anchor n="43" xml:id="d762-f1"/> told me last night
                    that he had seen Lozovski<anchor n="44" xml:id="d762-f2"/> “several times
                    recently” and that the latter had emphasized that if Japan wished a
                    non-aggression pact with the Soviet Union “it would be very difficult [”] for
                    the Soviet Union to refuse.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
